{"id":"35a06fac3604c479","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Antichain In Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree — ZFC Tree8 Antichain In Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree — ZFC Tree8 Antichain In Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-antichain-in-tree — ZFC Tree8 Antichain In Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,T,\\leq_T\\in V\">\\(A,T,\\leq_T\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}in\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S(A,T,\\leq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\nA\\subseteq T\n\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in A\\;\n\\bigl(\ns\\neq t\n\\to\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\notin\\leq_T\\land\\langle t,s\\rangle\\notin\\leq_T)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}antichain\\text{-}in\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8AntichainInTree}_S(A,T,\\leq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\nA\\subseteq T\n\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in A\\;\n\\bigl(\ns\\neq t\n\\to\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\notin\\leq_T\\land\\langle t,s\\rangle\\notin\\leq_T)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The tree order is an explicit set parameter, so incomparability is no longer expressed through an unbound subscripted symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-orde